OL,3,GNEWSACouncil buys 123 new homes for
OL,4,Asocial housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 120 council homes are to be
OL,7,Fadded to East Yorkshire's social
OL,8,Fhousing stock.
OL,10,FThe properties are being bought from
OL,11,Fdevelopers, with 97 homes acquired in
OL,12,FWithernsea and 26 in Driffield.
OL,14,FMost of them will be rental properties,
OL,15,Falthough some will be offered for
OL,16,Fpeople to buy under shared ownership
OL,17,Fschemes.
OL,19,FAn East Riding of Yorkshire Council
OL,20,Fspokesperson said: "The new homes will
OL,21,Fprovide opportunities for people to
OL,22,Fremain within their local communities."
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
